      {
        "id": 872799,
        "parent_id": 872794,
        "title": "Background",
        "description": null,
        "index": "1.2",
        "chapter": "1",
        "content": "<p class=\"level1\">The National Electricity Rules are made under the <a href=\"term_nel\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"global\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"term_nel\">NEL</a> and may be amended from time to time in accordance with the <a href=\"term_nel\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"global\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"term_nel\">NEL</a>.</p>",
        "content_type": "rule",
        "metadata": null,
        "links": {
          "self": "https://energy-rules.aemc.gov.au/api/v1/rules/803/content/872799",
          "parent": "https://energy-rules.aemc.gov.au/api/v1/rules/803/content/872794"
        },
        "parent": [],
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "id": 872800,
        "parent_id": 872794,
        "title": "Nomenclature of and references to provisions of a Chapter",
        "description": null,
        "index": "1.3",
        "chapter": "1",
        "content": null,
        "content_type": "rule",
        "metadata": null,
        "links": {
          "self": "https://energy-rules.aemc.gov.au/api/v1/rules/803/content/872800",
          "parent": "https://energy-rules.aemc.gov.au/api/v1/rules/803/content/872794"
        },
        "parent": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "id": 872801,
            "parent_id": 872800,
            "title": "Definitions",
            "description": null,
            "index": "1.3.1A1",
            "chapter": "1",
            "content": "<div class=\"localDef\"><p class=\"level1\">In this rule, \"<dfn id=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\">numbered</dfn>\" means identified by one or more numbers or one or more letters, or by a combination of one or more numbers and one or more letters.</p></div>",
            "content_type": "clause",
            "metadata": null,
            "links": {
              "self": "https://energy-rules.aemc.gov.au/api/v1/rules/803/content/872801",
              "parent": "https://energy-rules.aemc.gov.au/api/v1/rules/803/content/872800"
            },
            "parent": [],
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "id": 872802,
            "parent_id": 872800,
            "title": "Introduction",
            "description": null,
            "index": "1.3.1",
            "chapter": "1",
            "content": "<div class=\"prov1\" id=\"clause_1.3.1.a\"><span class=\"label\">(a)</span>This rule applies to provisions inserted after 16 November 2006, and applies unless the context otherwise requires.</div>",
            "content_type": "clause",
            "metadata": null,
            "links": {
              "self": "https://energy-rules.aemc.gov.au/api/v1/rules/803/content/872802",
              "parent": "https://energy-rules.aemc.gov.au/api/v1/rules/803/content/872800"
            },
            "parent": [],
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "id": 872803,
            "parent_id": 872800,
            "title": "Parts, Divisions and Subdivisions",
            "description": null,
            "index": "1.3.2",
            "chapter": "1",
            "content": "<div class=\"prov1\" id=\"clause_1.3.2.a\"><span class=\"label\">(a)</span>Chapters may contain <a href=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"local\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\">numbered</a> Parts.</div> <div class=\"prov1\" id=\"clause_1.3.2.b\"><span class=\"label\">(b)</span>Parts may contain <a href=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"local\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\">numbered</a> Divisions.</div> <div class=\"prov1\" id=\"clause_1.3.2.c\"><span class=\"label\">(c)</span>Divisions may contain <a href=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"local\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\">numbered</a> Subdivisions.</div> <div class=\"prov1\" id=\"clause_1.3.2.d\"><span class=\"label\">(d)</span>The following table indicates how Parts, Divisions and Subdivisions may be referred to in the <a href=\"term_rules\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"global\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"term_rules\">Rules</a>.</div> <table class=\"PageWide\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:16.69%;\"><col style=\"width:20.03%;\"><col style=\"width:31.05%;\"><col style=\"width:32.22%;\"></colgroup><thead><tr><th><p>Level</p></th><th><p>Provision</p></th><th><p>Internal reference in same level</p></th><th><p>External reference in preceding level</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p>1</p></td><td><p>Chapter 1</p></td><td><p> </p></td><td><p> </p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p>2</p></td><td><p>Part A</p></td><td><p>this Part</p></td><td><p>Part A</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p>3</p></td><td><p>Division 1</p></td><td><p>this Division</p></td><td><p>Division 1</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;\"><p>4</p></td><td><p>Subdivision 1</p></td><td><p>this Subdivision</p></td><td><p>Subdivision 1</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <p class=\"ruleLev3_explTitle\">Note:</p> <p class=\"ruleLev3_expl\">The numbering of the provisions in the table is by way of example.</p>",
            "content_type": "clause",
            "metadata": null,
            "links": {
              "self": "https://energy-rules.aemc.gov.au/api/v1/rules/803/content/872803",
              "parent": "https://energy-rules.aemc.gov.au/api/v1/rules/803/content/872800"
            },
            "parent": [],
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "id": 872804,
            "parent_id": 872800,
            "title": "Rules, clauses, paragraphs, subparagraphs and other items",
            "description": null,
            "index": "1.3.3",
            "chapter": "1",
            "content": "<div class=\"prov1\" id=\"clause_1.3.3.a\"><span class=\"label\">(a)</span>Chapters, Parts, Divisions and Subdivisions of the <a href=\"term_rules\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"global\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"term_rules\">Rules</a> may contain <a href=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"local\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\">numbered</a> rules.</div> <div class=\"prov1\" id=\"clause_1.3.3.b\"><span class=\"label\">(b)</span>Rules may contain <a href=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"local\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\">numbered</a> clauses.</div> <div class=\"prov1\" id=\"clause_1.3.3.c\"><span class=\"label\">(c)</span>Rules and clauses may contain <a href=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"local\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\">numbered</a> paragraphs.</div> <div class=\"prov1\" id=\"clause_1.3.3.d\"><span class=\"label\">(d)</span>Paragraphs may contain <a href=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"local\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\">numbered</a> subparagraphs.</div> <div class=\"prov1\" id=\"clause_1.3.3.e\"><span class=\"label\">(e)</span>Subparagraphs may contain <a href=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"local\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\">numbered</a> items.</div> <div class=\"prov1\" id=\"clause_1.3.3.f\"><span class=\"label\">(f)</span>The following table indicates how rules, clauses, paragraphs, subparagraphs and other <a href=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"local\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"chap_1_0_term_numbered\">numbered</a> items may be referred to in the <a href=\"term_rules\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"global\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"term_rules\">Rules</a>.</div> <table class=\"PageWide\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:16.58%;\"><col style=\"width:23.88%;\"><col style=\"width:28.86%;\"><col style=\"width:30.68%;\"></colgroup><thead><tr><th><p>Level</p></th><th><p>Provision</p></th><th><p>Internal reference in same level</p></th><th><p>External reference in preceding level</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Chapter, Part or Subdivision</p></td><td><p> </p></td><td><p> </p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>rule 1.2</p></td><td><p>this rule</p></td><td><p>rule 1.2</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>clause 1.2.3</p></td><td><p>this clause</p></td><td><p>clause 1.2.3</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>rule 1.2(a)</p><p>clause 1.2.3(a)</p></td><td><p>this paragraph</p><p>this paragraph</p></td><td><p>paragraph (a)</p><p>paragraph (a)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>rule 1.2(a)(1)</p><p>clause 1.2.3(a)(1)</p></td><td><p>this subparagraph</p><p>this subparagraph</p></td><td><p>subparagraph (1)</p><p>subparagraph (1)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>rule 1.2(a)(1)(i)</p><p>clause 1.2.3(a)(1)(i)</p></td><td><p>this rule 1.2(a)(1)(i)</p><p>this clause 1.2.3(a)(1)(i)</p></td><td><p>rule 1.2(a)(1)(i)</p><p>clause 1.2.3(a)(1)(i)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>rule 1.2(a)(1)(i)(A)</p><p>clause 1.2.3(a)(1)(i)(A)</p></td><td><p>this rule 1.2(a)(1)(i)(A)</p><p>this clause 1.2.3(a)(1)(i)(A)</p></td><td><p>rule 1.2(a)(1)(i)(A)</p><p>clause 1.2.3(a)(1)(i)(A)</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <p class=\"ruleLev3_explTitle\">Note:</p> <p class=\"ruleLev3_expl\">The numbering of the provisions in the table is by way of example.</p>",
            "content_type": "clause",
            "metadata": null,
            "links": {
              "self": "https://energy-rules.aemc.gov.au/api/v1/rules/803/content/872804",
              "parent": "https://energy-rules.aemc.gov.au/api/v1/rules/803/content/872800"
            },
            "parent": [],
            "children": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 872805,
        "parent_id": 872794,
        "title": "Effect of renumbering of provisions of the Rules",
        "description": null,
        "index": "1.4",
        "chapter": "1",
        "content": "<div class=\"prov1\" id=\"rule_1.4.a\"><span class=\"label\">(a)</span>The renumbering of a provision of the <a href=\"term_rules\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"global\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"term_rules\">Rules</a> by an <a href=\"term_amending_rule\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"global\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"term_amending_rule\">Amending Rule</a> does not affect anything done or omitted under the provision before the <a href=\"term_amending_rule\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"global\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"term_amending_rule\">Amending Rule</a> comes into operation.</div> <div class=\"prov1\" id=\"rule_1.4.b\"><span class=\"label\">(b)</span>A reference (however expressed) in the <a href=\"term_rules\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"global\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"term_rules\">Rules</a> or in any other document to that provision is taken to be a reference to the provision as renumbered.</div> <div class=\"prov1\" id=\"rule_1.4.c\"><span class=\"label\">(c)</span>Paragraphs (a) and (b) have effect whether or not the renumbered provision is also relocated.</div>",
        "content_type": "rule",
        "metadata": null,
        "links": {
          "self": "https://energy-rules.aemc.gov.au/api/v1/rules/803/content/872805",
          "parent": "https://energy-rules.aemc.gov.au/api/v1/rules/803/content/872794"
        },
        "parent": [],
        "children": []
      },
